cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use EDDY, please cite it as below. Please also cite ARDY."
type: software
title: "Llama-3-EDDY-Qwen3-Embedding-8B: Embedding aDapter for ARDY (EDDY)"
abstract: "Built with Meta Llama 3. EDDY maps a Qwen3-Embedding-8B text vector to the LLM2Vec vector that NVIDIA's ARDY text-to-motion model expects, so ARDY runs without the LLM2Vec text encoder."
authors:
  - given-names: "Cyril"
    family-names: "Tsui"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Xyri1/EDDY"
date-released: "2026-10-29"
keywords:
  - text-to-motion
  - embeddings
  - adapter
  - ARDY
license: Apache-2.0
